1: ESP32 runs local HTTP server (POST /start, POST /stop, GET /status, GET /eeg).
2: No account binding required for ESP32; it transmits raw EEG locally to the phone device / python bridge.
3: The phone / bridge connects locally to the ESP32 and posts EEG telemetry directly to the web app (/api/eeg).
4: Before the start of the recording (at position camera step), live camera feed is active and visible for alignment.
5: Real hardware ADS1115 sampling at 250 SPS with fallback to synthetic EEG.